# Stage 0 working data — regenerate with the scripts in stage0/src/.
# Summaries and reports are committed; bulk candidate sets are not.
stage0/data/*.parquet
stage0/data/*.jsonl
stage0/data/cache/

# The fetch cache holds the extracted TEXT of other people's websites, a few
# thousand characters per business. 160 of these had been committed — 2.1 MB of
# third-party page content in a public repo, which is exactly what "store
# extracted facts, not page copies" (CLAUDE.md) exists to prevent. It is also a
# derived artifact: `benchmark/run.py` rebuilds it by crawling.
#
# Untracking does not remove it from history. See the decision log entry of
# 2026-09-21; purging needs a history rewrite and is the repo owner's call.
stage0/data/fetch-cache/
stage0/data/labelling/

# OS
.DS_Store
